  "notes": "Real 4-storey cream apartment block. Warm sandstone-cream render, windows framed by brown roller-shutter boxes (#b98a5e). Right-hand stair tower expressed as a narrow volume clad with vertical grey louvre fins (#b0aca2 slat band, actually vertical). Recessed balconies with brown parapets. Flat roof. To the left a second block with brown balcony boxes (out of footprint). Street frontage: a low concrete boundary wall carrying FIFA graffiti and a white picket rail, hedges. Colours sampled from ref 2026-07-04. Environment 2026-07-05: left cluster of large round bushes on the raised planter, a row of tall dark cypress/araucaria conifers on the right behind the wall, green dumpster at the right kerb and a white car parked on the road."
